.TH FOREST 1 "July 2026" "forest" "Forest desktop environment"
.SH NAME
forest \- Forest desktop environment main process
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forest
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B forest
is the main process of the Forest desktop environment. It loads the
configured app plugins (desktop, panel, and services), registers
.B org.forest
on the D-Bus session bus, and applies the active Forest theme's global
stylesheet.
.PP
It is not intended to be run directly; it is started as part of a Forest
session by
.BR forest-session (1).
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/Forest/Forest.conf
.RS
Per-user settings, including which app plugins are enabled and the active
theme.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forest-session (1),
.BR forest-settings (1)
